    "detailed_description": "An army of contraptions swarm the skies, and it is up to you, a lone sorcerer to defend the castle wall.<br><br><i>LET NONE PASS!</i><br><br>Move quickly, dash quicker, and bam, boom, blast them out of the sky with your magic.<br>See how long you can last in this simple and stylish score attack game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to learn controls for young acolytes to ancient sorcerers. <br></li><li>Leaderboards to compete against your foes and friends.<br></li><li>2 game modes: Endless and Timed.<br></li><li><strong>Endless</strong> - Keep playing until a contraption escapes.<br></li><li><strong>Timed</strong> - 45 seconds of mayhem.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255630/extras/a685809c01d04db669d65d1d0b18f8eb.poster.avif?t=1680712252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255630/extras/a685809c01d04db669d65d1d0b18f8eb.webm?t=1680712252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255630/extras/a685809c01d04db669d65d1d0b18f8eb.mp4?t=1680712252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Dash in, have fun!",
